        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "See the section titled “Risk Factors—Risks Relating To Our Business and Industry—The market in which we participate is competitive and rapidly changing, and if we do not compete effectively with established companies as well as new market entrants or maintain and develop strategic relationships with third parties, our business, results of operations and financial condition could be harmed.”",
        "start_character": 7038,
        "end_character": 7431
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe in a sustainable fashion future and we are proud that our business model creates a positive impact to the benefit of our buyers, sellers, clients, employees, investors and the environment.",
        "start_character": 184,
        "end_character": 383
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We compete primarily on the basis of buyer and seller experience, product quality and assortment, breadth of brand offering, convenience and price.",
        "start_character": 7432,
        "end_character": 7579
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Although we have built a scaled and highly differentiated platform and managed marketplace, we face intense competition.",
        "start_character": 5722,
        "end_character": 5842
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "By locating our facilities in strategic locations across the country, we can be closer to our buyers and sellers, which allows us to reduce shipping times in transit, and lower our inbound and outbound shipping costs.",
        "start_character": 2860,
        "end_character": 3077
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Many jurisdictions in which we operate have enacted laws and regulations requiring notification to users when there is a security breach of personal data, or requiring the adoption of minimum information security standards that are often vaguely defined and difficult to practically implement.",
        "start_character": 10990,
        "end_character": 11283
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "ThredUp’s proprietary operating platform is the foundation for our managed marketplace, where we have bridged online and offline technology to make the buying and selling of tens of millions of unique items easy and fun.",
        "start_character": 720,
        "end_character": 940
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that we are able to compete effectively because we offer buyers a vast selection of high-quality, secondhand and resale items at compelling prices with a fun and easy to use interface.",
        "start_character": 7580,
        "end_character": 7775
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continually review our development efforts to assess the existence and patentability of new intellectual property.",
        "start_character": 8454,
        "end_character": 8571
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are subject to a variety of United States federal and state laws as well as international laws that affect companies conducting business on the Internet and in the retail industry, many of which are still evolving and could be interpreted in ways that could harm our business.",
        "start_character": 9534,
        "end_character": 9813
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are also subject to environmental laws, rules and regulations.",
        "start_character": 12045,
        "end_character": 12110
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001484778-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001484778-26-000007-c90012c652c94bd2",
        "accession_number": "0001484778-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-02",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "We are also subject to federal, state, and foreign laws and regulations regarding privacy and protection of consumer information.",
        "start_character": 10506,
        "end_character": 10635
      }
    ]
